  "conditions": {
    "grafana-fixed-backends": "Admin-only provisioning, anonymous access/sign-up disabled, no public endpoint in this release. Fixed internal HTTP metrics/log/trace destinations and verified private-CA PostgreSQL TLS. No public egress or AWS/API token. Restricted non-root filesystem, CPU/memory/connections bounded. Bundled plugins remain vulnerable; unrelated datasource plugins disabled. No claim that dependency findings are fixed or unreachable.",
    "tempo-no-jwk": "Private OTLP ingestion only from scoped Collectors; no JWT/OAuth/JWK authentication module configured. S3 SDK federation uses exact-subject AWS STS, not caller-supplied JWKs. Restricted non-root runtime and bounded ingestion/query resources. Dependency remains vulnerable.",
    "collector-no-jwk": "Only OTLP receivers and health/file-storage extensions are enabled; no OAuth/JWT/JWK extension. Private ingestion from scoped platform Pods; fixed Loki/Tempo exports, no public egress or API/AWS token. Memory limiter, bounded persistent queues, retries and resource limits. Dependency remains vulnerable."
  },
